    "text": "\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 \u00ferym wucon \u00e6r myddan wyntran on \u00feone friged\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone sunnand\u00e6g \u00e6r myddan wyntra.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone viii d\u00e6g godes \u00e6tywednysse.\n\u00d0ys sceal on Sancte Andreas m\u00e6sse\u00e6fen.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on sunnand\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6re o\u00f0re wucan ofer epiphania.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re feor\u00f0an wucan ynnan lengtene on monand\u00e6g.\n\u00deys godspel man sceal r\u00e6dan ofer eastron be \u00fe\u00e6re rode & eft ofer pentecosten on \u00feone forman\n\u00d0ys sceal on o\u00f0erne pentecostenes m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feryddan wucan ofer eastron.\n\u00d0ys sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re iii lengten wucan.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 ofer pentecosten on \u00fe\u00e6re an & twentygo\u00f0an wucan on sunnand\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re forman lengten wucan.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on \u00feunresd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re feor\u00f0an lencten wucan.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00feursd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re o\u00f0re lencten wucan.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on mydlenctenes sunnand\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re forman wucan \u00e6fter epiphania domini.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan.\n\u00d0ys sceal anum d\u00e6ge \u00e6r palmsunnand\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0ys sceal on tywesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re fiftan wucan innan lengtene.\n\u00d0ys sceal on mydlengtenes wucan on tywesd\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys sceal on monand\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re fyftan wucan innan lenctene.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on \u00feuresd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re fiftan wucan innan lenctene.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 anum d\u00e6ge \u00e6r mydfastene.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re mydf\u00e6stenes wucan on s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on monand\u00e6g on 